<section class="overflow-hidden">
  
  <!-- Weddings Section -->
  <div id="weddings" class="py-24 scroll-mt-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16">
        <!-- Text Column -->
        <div class="lg:w-1/2 anim-fade stagger-1">
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-gold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 block">The Big Day</span>
          <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 leading-tight">Weddings</h2>
          <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-600 space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
            <p>Organising a wedding is like running a marathon. You think all has been taken care of but then suddenly you remember 100 things that are yet to be done. Well, don’t waste the wedding fun with these troubles. Sit back and let us take care.</p>
            <p>We offer a complete wedding solution for small, big and online wedding functions. Be it Roka, Sangeet, Engagement, Cocktail or other functions, we will walk through it all with you.</p>
            <p>All you need to do is select the design for the wedding card, choose gifts for Shagan Baskets, select floral decor options all from the comfort of your living room. Let our runners run around the town fetching from designer lehengas, luxury brand items to pooja mouli and gangajal.</p>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">Let’s get started by making a list of things to be done. Then send in your request to our concierge and let our team of experts take over and curate a wedding experience to remember!</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Visual Column -->
        <div class="lg:w-1/2 anim-right stagger-2 relative">
          <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/5] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
            <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0748/1766/7150/files/hero-banner.png" alt="Wedding Gifting & Decor" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80" loading="lazy">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-gray-900/40 to-transparent"></div>
          </div>
          <!-- Floating badge -->
          <div class="absolute -bottom-8 -left-8 bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100 max-w-xs anim-up stagger-4 hidden md:block">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-gold mb-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/></svg>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">End-to-End Solutions</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">From Shagan Baskets to Floral Decor.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Parties Section -->
  <div id="parties" class="py-24 bg-gray-50 scroll-mt-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-16">
        <!-- Text Column -->
        <div class="lg:w-1/2 anim-fade stagger-1">
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-gold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 block">Celebrations</span>
          <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 leading-tight">Parties</h2>
          <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-600 space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
            <p>Let’s celebrate parties together, choose from our wide selection of cakes, balloons, gifts, flowers, mithai and more. We are the perfect partners for birthday, anniversary, promotion, luncheon, graduation, pooja, Diwali cards party or any other occasion.</p>
            <p>We also offer specialised theme based solutions for kid’s birthday parties, bridal showers, baby showers, bachelor/bachelorette parties.</p>
            <p>You can even put together a party as per your specifications. Contact our concierge and we will be at your service. Let’s plan a surprise party together, or ring in at midnight. We provide round the clock and round the year services.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Visual Column -->
        <div class="lg:w-1/2 anim-left stagger-2 relative">
          <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/5] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
            <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0748/1766/7150/files/corporate_hero.jpg" alt="Party Planning & Gifts" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80" loading="lazy">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-gray-900/40 to-transparent"></div>
          </div>
          <!-- Floating badge -->
          <div class="absolute -top-8 -right-8 bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100 max-w-xs anim-down stagger-4 hidden md:block">
            <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🎉</span>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">Surprise Planning</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Round the clock, round the year services.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Gifting Tiers Section -->
  <div id="gifting-tiers" class="py-32 scroll-mt-24 relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Abstract background -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-white via-cream to-blush opacity-50"></div>
    
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-20 anim-up">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Our Gifting Approaches</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Whether you know exactly what you want, or need a curated solution, we have a tier designed for you.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        
        <!-- Tailor Made -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-10 shadow-xl border-t-4 border-gold relative overflow-hidden group hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 anim-up stagger-1" id="tailored">
          <svg class="absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 w-40 h-40 text-gray-50 opacity-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700 pointer-events-none" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2L1 21h22L12 2zm0 3.8l7.2 14.2H4.8L12 5.8z"/></svg>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 relative z-10">Tailor Made Gifts</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed relative z-10">Get your gifts customized as per your logo and branding. Add the personal touch with our bespoke branding and packaging solutions. You may even get your own merchandise branded and delivered by us. Let's work together.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Ready Made -->
        <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-3xl p-10 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden group hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 anim-up stagger-2" id="readymade">
          <!-- Soft glow behind -->
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-gold/20 blur-3xl rounded-full"></div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-4 relative z-10">Ready Made Gifts</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed relative z-10">Curate your order from our wide product offerings. Pick a budget and select the gifts of your liking. Get corporate or bulk discounts on orders above 6 items.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Bespoke Branding -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-10 shadow-xl border-t-4 border-gold relative overflow-hidden group hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 anim-up stagger-3" id="bespoke">
          <svg class="absolute -left-4 -bottom-4 w-40 h-40 text-gray-50 opacity-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700 pointer-events-none" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21.5 12c0 5.25-4.25 9.5-9.5 9.5S2.5 17.25 2.5 12 6.75 2.5 12 2.5s9.5 4.25 9.5 9.5z" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/></svg>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 relative z-10">Bespoke Branding & Packaging</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed relative z-10">Got something on your wishlist that we have not listed? Don’t worry, we’ll arrange it for you. Let’s connect over a cup of coffee or on a virtual chat. Our expert designers and aestheticians will craft and curate the most fitting branding and packaging solutions that match your style and will make a statement.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Detailed Services",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Detailed Services" }]
}
{% endschema %}
